  "issue": 451,
  "request": "Goal: approval step completion and spec task synchronization must succeed or fail as one atomic update. Scope: src/flow/lib/set-step.js, src/flow/lib/sync-spec-tasks.js, and focused failure/retry/idempotency tests for write failure, parse failure, and target mismatch. Preserve the existing successful approval/task update contract and the target/CAS guards delivered by Issue #443. Out of Scope: unrelated task lifecycle, review/gate/finalize tooling, broad flow transaction redesign, compatibility fallbacks, warning-based error suppression, dependencies, allowlists, or skipped/reduced tests. Spec load errors must propagate; any failure must leave both flow state and spec task state byte-equivalent to their pre-call state; one retry with the same input must not leave partial updates.",
